    <note x="240" y="60" backgroundDark="0" fontSize="11" width="285" markdown="false" height="56" textColorDark="-1" textColorLight="-16777216" backgroundLight="0">This NetLogo program is a tool to parameterize fish species and export them as csv files to import into the FishCensus Model (FishCensus.nlogox).</note>
